Additional fields in interactive create change only what was selected (priority); unselected fields keep their defaults: the team's first unstarted state, no labels, self-assignment from LINEAR_ISSUE_CREATE_ASSIGN_SELF=always, and no priority.
-- seed.json --
{"Project": [{"id": "1e000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009", "name": "Release", "slugId": "r1b2c3d4e5f6", "teams": ["0c000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"]}],
 "IssueLabel": [{"$repeat": 101, "name": "Chore {{n:3}}", "team": "0c000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "color": "#888888"},
  {"id": "0e000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099", "name": "Picked", "team": "0c000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "color": "#ff0000", "createdAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"}]}
-- env --
LINEAR_TEAM_KEY=ENG
LINEAR_ISSUE_CREATE_ASSIGN_SELF=always
-- tty --
expect What's the title of your issue?
send Draft title\r
expect Description
send Existing description\r
expect What's next?
send \e[B\r
expect Select additional fields to configure
send \e[B
send \e[B
send  
send \r
expect Press ↵ again to submit
send \r
expect What priority should this issue have?
send \r
